{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key whose value a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination reads from the record’s context: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey","type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app, device, operating system and locale are read once, when the enricher is made, never per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event. The network connection changes while the app runs, so on Apple platforms "},{"code":"network()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"code":"NWPathMonitor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own and sets the latest connection on each record. Give each tracker its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own call. Off Apple platforms there is no device and no path monitor, so those two enrichers set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing, and a server or tool, whose process usually has no Info.plist, passes its own app to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"application(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", made on the main actor, adds the platform’s identifier for vendor as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value. It is the one identifier here that outlives a session, so add it only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app has decided to and has the user’s consent. It is never stored or made up: on macOS and Linux,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which have none, records carry no key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the session an event was tracked in, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sessions"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"code":["import StandardContext","import Trackers","","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.application(), .operatingSystem(), .locale(), .network()])","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","\/\/ A destination reads each value from the record's context:","\/\/ record.context[ApplicationKey.self]?.version, record.context[OperatingSystemKey.self]?.name"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"ide